<view class="page"><scene-backdrop/><view class="eyebrow">EVERY STROKE COUNTS</view><view class="title">本轮成绩</view><view class="sub">{{r.courseName}} · {{date}}</view><view class="card space"><view class="muted">我的实际总杆 · {{mine.played}} / {{r.holes.length}} 洞</view><view style="font-size:100rpx;font-weight:300;margin:24rpx 0">{{mine.totalText}}</view><view class="pill">修订 {{r.revision}} · {{finished?'本轮已结束':editing?'更正尚未提交':'进行中'}}</view></view><view class="section">主赛结果</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text>{{main.title}}</text><text class="pill">{{main.state}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{recordOnly}}" class="sub">仅记录成绩，不设主赛冠军或名次。</view><view wx:elif="{{main.result}}" class="section">{{main.winner}} {{main.result}}</view><view wx:for="{{main.rows}}" wx:key="id" class="row space"><text>{{item.rank || '—'}} · {{item.name}}（{{item.played}}洞）</text><text>{{item.played?item.total:'—'}} {{main.unit}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{main.explanation}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{side.length}}" class="section">附加玩法 · 独立结算</view><view wx:for="{{side}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{item.state}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{item.contests}}" wx:for-item="c" wx:key="contestId" class="row space"><text>{{c.label}} · {{c.state}}</text><text>{{c.winner}} {{c.result}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{item.totals}}" wx:for-item="t" wx:key="id" class="row space"><text>{{t.name}}</text><text>{{t.text}} {{item.unit}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.unallocated}}" class="muted">未分配 {{item.unallocated}} 点，不自动平分。</view></view><view class="section">完整记分卡</view><view class="segment"><view class="{{half==='front'?'active':''}}" data-id="front" bindtap="half">前九洞</view><view wx:if="{{r.holes.length>9}}" class="{{half==='back'?'active':''}}" data-id="back" bindtap="half">后九洞</view></view><view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row player-summary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand"><view class="grow"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="note">已完 {{item.played}} / {{r.holes.length}} 洞</view></view><view class="live-total">{{item.liveTotal}}<text>总杆 · {{item.diffText}}</text></view><text>{{item.open?'⌃':'⌄'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.open}}"><view class="note spaced">实际前九 {{item.frontN?item.front:'—'}} / 后九 {{item.backN?item.back:'—'}}</view><view class="journal-cards"><view wx:for="{{item.cards}}" wx:for-item="c" wx:key="number" class="journal-card" data-number="{{c.number}}" bindtap="edit"><view class="row"><text>{{c.number}} 洞</text><text class="note">PAR {{c.par}}</text></view><view class="row spaced"><view class="score-mark {{c.kind}}">{{c.value}}</view><text class="note">{{c.label}}</text></view></view></view></view></view><view class="note">总杆按本轮标准杆加已完球洞杆差显示，未记录球洞仍为空白；实际成绩仅合计完洞记录。</view><view class="menu row" bindtap="calculations"><text>让杆与比赛计算明细</text><text>{{calculation?'收起':'展开'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{calculation}}"><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="number" class="card"><view>第 {{item.number}} 洞 · PAR {{item.par}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.values}}" wx:for-item="v" wx:key="id" class="menu row"><text>{{v.id}}</text><view><view>实际 {{v.raw}}</view><view class="note">让 {{v.allowance}} · 净 {{v.net}} · 计 {{v.derived}}</view></view></view></view></view><view class="result-actions"><button class="primary result-share" bindtap="share">分享这一场好球 →</button><button bindtap="rules">本场规则与让杆</button><button wx:if="{{finished}}" bindtap="beginEdit">更正成绩</button><button wx:else bindtap="resume">{{editing?'继续更正':'继续本轮记分'}}</button></view><view class="menu row result-more" bindtap="toggleActions"><text>更多操作</text><text>{{moreActions?'收起 −':'展开 ＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{moreActions}}" class="result-actions result-secondary"><button bindtap="reviseRules">更正规则与球洞</button><button bindtap="copy">复制成绩与修订号</button><button wx:if="{{needsSourceConfirmation}}" bindtap="confirmSources">核对旧记录来源</button></view><view class="section">修订记录</view><view wx:for="{{log}}" wx:key="revision" class="card">修订 {{item.revision}} · {{item.reason}}<view class="muted">{{item.date}}</view></view></view>
<privacy-panel/>